This repository vendors Protocol Buffers (.proto) definitions under proto/,
copied from the Hyperledger Fabric protobuf definitions:

    Project:  Hyperledger Fabric Protos
    Source:   https://github.com/hyperledger/fabric-protos
    License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
    Copyright: The Hyperledger Fabric contributors

The original SPDX-License-Identifier headers are preserved verbatim in each
vendored .proto file. These files are compiled at build time by tonic-build to
generate the wire types used to communicate with a Hyperledger Fabric peer's
Gateway service.

This crate is a port of the Go client from the Hyperledger Fabric Gateway
project (https://github.com/hyperledger/fabric-gateway), also Apache-2.0
licensed. No source is copied from that project; only its public behaviour and
wire format are reproduced.
